title: The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Fuehrer State**</span>...
subtitle: The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Fuehrer State**</span> will be established
new-page: true
view-if: nazi_year == 1 and nazi_month >= 3 and chancellor_party = "NSDAP" and (president = "Hitler" or president = "Göring") and fuehrer_state != 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.president = "Hitler";
Q.fuehrer_state = 1;
Q.fuehrer_name = "Adolf Hitler";
!}

<span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Adolf Hitler**</span> is assuming the powers of the Presidency while retaining the office of Chancellor. This marks the final end of democracy in Germany.

